WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.920
These are our Guides.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.820
Each one is a mini website about one topic,

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:07.120
walked through by one of our Guides, like me.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.420
Find them by what you care about:

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:13.980
food, health, travel, game day, business and the animals.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.400
Guides for your work, like the Vegan Restaurant Guide,

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.220
open free with a short survey.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.280
Topic Guides, like the Vegan Dairy Guide,

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.260
are yours to keep with points, and every one has a free part to try.

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:28.460
We want to hear from you.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.540
As a member, you shape what we build next:

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:36.240
ask your Guide anything, tap Notify me on the Guides you want first,

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.640
let us know if something needs to be fixed,

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:41.220
and tell us what you wish we had a Guide for.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.340
Membership is free.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:47.380
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.740
and that keeps this community worth your time.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:51.520
Bring people with you:

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:56.480
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:00.380
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:05.740
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.300
community.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:09.100
Pick a Guide and start exploring.

